Subject: Name shipped kube-agents skills for handoffs

Why: Upstream names three sibling skills (`gke-node-notready`, `gke-workload-scaling-troubleshooting`, `gke-ai-troubleshooting-tpu-reservation-stockout`) that do not exist in this repository; `SKILL.md`'s frontmatter `description` is copied into the published skill catalog (`README.md` and `docs/site/src/content/docs/skills/index.mdx`) by `make docs-generate`. Naming shipped kube-agents skills keeps handoff guidance and published docs accurate.
Local-Issue: none (adoption of gke-kueue-troubleshooting from google/skills)
